  <result aggregation-status="0" type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output A.1. Enhanced decent work statistics using innovative sources and statistical standards</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In July 2023, the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Development formed the Labour Market Information System (LMIS) Task Force to ensure a proper operationalization of the System whose successful implementation and functioning was announced in December 2023. With the support from the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia, the ILO conducted several online consultations and a mission to KSA to establish the LMIS task force and enhance the institutional capacities of the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Development. The ILO provided technical support to the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Development to solve its technical challenges and ensure its successful implementation.</narrative>
   </description>
